OL,3,GNEWSALifeboat crew warning over
OL,4,A'tombstoning' after boy, 14, injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat crew has issued a warning
OL,7,Fabout the dangers of "tombstoning"
OL,8,Fafter a teenager was seriously injured
OL,9,Fjumping into a harbour.
OL,11,FDunbar RNLI said the 14-year-old
OL,12,Finjured his leg after plunging into the
OL,13,Fwater at about 18:30 on Thursday.
OL,15,FTombstoning is the practice of jumping
OL,16,Fstraight and stiff like a tombstone
OL,17,Ffrom a high structure.
OL,23,APub: 15-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
